  Rendered from sections/main-policy.liquid.
  Aligns with shipping-policy damage (48h) and prepaid/cancellation language.
  Does not invent return addresses, legal entity names, or statutory waivers.
{%- endcomment -%}

<nav class="ar-pol__toc ar-pol-reveal" aria-label="Refund and return policy sections">
  <a class="ar-pol__toc-link" href="#ar-ref-intro">Overview</a>
  <a class="ar-pol__toc-link" href="#ar-ref-change">Change of mind</a>
  <a class="ar-pol__toc-link" href="#ar-ref-damage">Damage &amp; defects</a>
  <a class="ar-pol__toc-link" href="#ar-ref-process">How to return</a>
  <a class="ar-pol__toc-link" href="#ar-ref-refund">Refunds</a>
  <a class="ar-pol__toc-link" href="#ar-ref-cancel">Cancellations</a>
  <a class="ar-pol__toc-link" href="#ar-ref-contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<div class="ar-pol__glance ar-pol-reveal" aria-label="Returns at a glance">
  <article class="ar-pol__glance-card">
    <p class="ar-pol__glance-title">Change of mind</p>
    <p>Unopened, unused fragrance in original packaging may be eligible within the return window after delivery.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="ar-pol__glance-card">
    <p class="ar-pol__glance-title">Opened products</p>
    <p>Opened or used bottles are not eligible for change-of-mind returns, but defects, damage, or wrong items are still covered.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="ar-pol__glance-card">
    <p class="ar-pol__glance-title">Issues on delivery</p>
    <p>Report damaged, leaking, missing, or incorrect items promptly with photos and your order number.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="ar-pol__glance-card">
    <p class="ar-pol__glance-title">How to start</p>
    <p>Contact support before sending anything back. We confirm eligibility and share return instructions.</p>
  </article>
</div>

<div class="ar-pol__content">
  <p class="ar-pol__updated ar-pol-reveal"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 24 August 2026</p>

  <section id="ar-ref-intro" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-intro">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-intro" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">1.</span> Refund &amp; Return Policy</h2>
    <p>
      This Refund &amp; Return Policy explains how <strong>Anand Rasa</strong> handles returns, replacements, cancellations, and refunds
      for prepaid fragrance and attar orders placed on <a href="{{ shop.url }}">{{ shop.domain }}</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      It is written for customers in India in plain language.
      Nothing in this policy is intended to limit rights available to you under applicable Indian consumer protection or e-commerce law.
      This page is informational and is not a certification of legal compliance.
    </p>
    <p>
      Delivery timelines and logistics are covered in our
      <a href="{{ ar_shipping_url }}">Shipping Policy</a>.
      Privacy practices are covered in our
      <a href="{{ ar_privacy_url }}">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-change" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-change">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-change" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">2.</span> Change-of-mind returns</h2>
    <p>
      If you ordered the correct product but no longer want it, you may request a change-of-mind return
      within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong>, subject to the eligibility conditions below.
    </p>
    <p class="ar-pol__note">
      <strong>Business confirmation:</strong> confirm that the 30-day change-of-mind window remains your intended commercial policy.
      If you use a different window, update this section before relying on it in customer communications.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-eligibility" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-eligibility">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-eligibility" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">3.</span> Eligibility conditions</h2>
    <p>For a change-of-mind return to be considered, the item generally must be:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Requested within the return window after delivery</li>
      <li><strong>Unopened and unused</strong> (seal intact where a seal was present)</li>
      <li>In the same sellable condition as received</li>
      <li>In its original packaging, with product labels and any included inserts</li>
      <li>Accompanied by proof of purchase (order number / invoice)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Custom, personalised, or specially made-to-order items (if offered) may not be eligible for change-of-mind returns.
      Gift cards, if offered, are not returnable once issued.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-opened" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-opened">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-opened" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">4.</span> Opened or used fragrance products</h2>
    <p>
      Fragrance and attar are personal-care products. For hygiene and product integrity,
      <strong>opened, sprayed, sampled, or otherwise used bottles are not eligible for change-of-mind returns</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      This does <strong>not</strong> remove remedies for legitimate issues.
      If a product is defective, leaking, damaged in transit, or is the wrong item,
      you may still request a remedy even if the bottle was opened to discover the problem.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-damage" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-damage">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-damage" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">5.</span> Damaged, leaking, or defective products</h2>
    <p>
      Please inspect your package on delivery.
      If an item arrives damaged, leaking, or appears defective, contact us within
      <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> with:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your order number</li>
      <li>A clear description of the issue</li>
      <li>Photos or short video of the packaging and product (where relevant)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Eligible cases are handled with a replacement or refund after we review the details.
      Where the issue is our responsibility or a courier-related damage claim we support,
      we will not ask you to bear unfair costs for a remedy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-wrong" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-wrong">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-wrong" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">6.</span> Wrong or missing products</h2>
    <p>
      If you receive the wrong product, an incomplete order, or a missing item,
      contact us within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> with your order number and photos if useful.
      We will arrange a correction — typically by sending the correct item, completing the missing item, or issuing a refund for the affected portion.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-process" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-process">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-process" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">7.</span> Return request procedure</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Contact us by email, phone, or the <a href="{{ ar_contact_url }}">Contact page</a> before sending any parcel back.</li>
      <li>Share your order number, reason for return, and photos if the issue is damage, defect, leak, or wrong item.</li>
      <li>Wait for our confirmation. If the return is accepted, we will share return instructions and the return address to use.</li>
      <li>Pack the item securely in its original packaging so it arrives safely.</li>
      <li>Ship only as instructed. Parcels sent without prior approval may not be accepted.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="ar-pol__note">
      <strong>Business confirmation:</strong> do not publish a warehouse return address on this page until it is verified.
      After approval, support will share the correct return address for that request.
      Correspondence address on file:
      {{ ar_address | escape }}.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-shipping" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-shipping">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-shipping" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">8.</span> Return shipping responsibility</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Change-of-mind returns:</strong> return shipping is generally arranged and paid by the customer,
        unless we tell you otherwise in writing for your specific case.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Damaged, defective, leaking, wrong, or missing items:</strong> where the issue is our responsibility,
        we will arrange a fair resolution. That may include a prepaid return label, pickup guidance, replacement without return,
        or refund — depending on the case.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We do not automatically promise a prepaid return label for every return.
      Support will confirm shipping arrangements when your request is approved.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-inspect" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-inspect">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-inspect" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">9.</span> Inspection and approval</h2>
    <p>
      After we receive a returned item, we inspect it to confirm condition and eligibility.
      We will notify you whether the return is approved.
      If a return does not meet the change-of-mind conditions (for example, opened or used when that was not disclosed),
      we may decline the refund and discuss next steps with you, including return of the item where practicable.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-refund" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-refund">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-refund" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">10.</span> Refund method and processing</h2>
    <p>
      Approved refunds are issued to the <strong>original payment method</strong> used at checkout.
      After approval, we aim to process the refund within <strong>10 business days</strong>.
      Your bank or payment provider may take additional time to post the credit.
    </p>
    <p>
      Shipping charges paid at checkout are refunded when the return or cancellation is due to our error,
      a covered quality/damage issue, or non-fulfilment.
      For approved change-of-mind returns, original outbound shipping may be non-refundable unless we state otherwise.
    </p>
    <p class="ar-pol__note">
      <strong>Business confirmation:</strong> confirm the 10-business-day post-approval processing target and whether outbound shipping is refunded on change-of-mind returns.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-cancel" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-cancel">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-cancel" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">11.</span> Cancellation before and after dispatch</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Before dispatch:</strong> contact us as soon as possible with your order number.
        Prepaid orders cancelled before dispatch are refunded to the original payment method after we confirm the order has not shipped.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>After dispatch:</strong> cancellation may not be possible once the parcel is with the courier.
        You may refuse delivery where the courier allows, or follow the return process in this policy after delivery.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Orders on this store are <strong>prepaid only</strong> (Cash on Delivery is not offered). See our
      <a href="{{ ar_shipping_url }}">Shipping Policy</a> for payment and delivery details.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-exchange" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-exchange">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-exchange" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">12.</span> Exchanges and replacements</h2>
    <p>
      For damaged, defective, leaking, wrong, or missing items, we typically offer a <strong>replacement</strong> of the same product when stock is available,
      or a refund if replacement is not suitable.
    </p>
    <p>
      Change-of-mind preference swaps (different scent or size) are handled as a return plus a new purchase when stock allows,
      unless we agree a direct exchange for your specific order.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-promo" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-promo">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-promo" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">13.</span> Promotional offers and free gifts</h2>
    <p>
      If your order included a free gift, sample, or promotional item tied to a purchase threshold or offer,
      you may be asked to return that item with the paid product for a change-of-mind return to be completed,
      or the gift’s value may be deducted from the refund where the gift is not returned and the offer conditions require it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Discounted sale items follow the same quality and damage remedies as regular-priced items.
      Change-of-mind eligibility still depends on the unopened/unused conditions above.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-force" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-force">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-force" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">14.</span> Force majeure and exceptional delivery situations</h2>
    <p>
      Events beyond reasonable control — including severe weather, natural events, courier network disruption, strikes, or government restrictions —
      may affect delivery or return logistics.
      In such cases we will share available updates and work toward a fair resolution.
      Statutory consumer rights continue to apply.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-contact" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-contact">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-contact" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">15.</span> Contact support</h2>
    <p>For return, refund, replacement, or cancellation requests, contact Anand Rasa support with your order number:</p>
    <ul class="ar-pol__cards" role="list">
      <li class="ar-pol__card">
        <span class="ar-pol__card-label">Email</span>
        <a class="ar-pol__card-value" href="mailto:{{ ar_email | escape }}">{{ ar_email | escape }}</a>
      </li>
      <li class="ar-pol__card">
        <span class="ar-pol__card-label">Phone</span>
        <a class="ar-pol__card-value" href="tel:{{ ar_phone_href | replace: ' ', '' | escape }}">{{ ar_phone_display | escape }}</a>
      </li>
      <li class="ar-pol__card">
        <span class="ar-pol__card-label">Contact form</span>
        <a class="ar-pol__card-value" href="{{ ar_contact_url }}">Contact us</a>
      </li>
      <li class="ar-pol__card">
        <span class="ar-pol__card-label">Merchant address</span>
        <span class="ar-pol__card-value">{{ ar_address | escape }}</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-ref-grievance" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-ref-h-grievance">
    <h2 id="ar-ref-h-grievance" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">16.</span> Grievance redressal</h2>
    <p>
      If you are not satisfied with how a return, refund, or related complaint was handled,
      email us at
      <a href="mailto:{{ ar_email | escape }}?subject=Refund%20grievance">{{ ar_email | escape }}</a>
      with the subject line “Refund grievance”, your order number, and a clear summary of the issue and outcome you seek.
    </p>
    <p>
      We will review the complaint and respond through the same support channels.
      You may also use remedies available under applicable Indian consumer protection law.
    </p>
    <p class="ar-pol__note">
      <strong>Legal/business confirmation:</strong> if you appoint a named grievance officer under applicable rules,
      add that name and contact details here after verification. Do not invent an officer title or identity.
    </p>
  </section>

  <nav class="ar-pol__related ar-pol-reveal" aria-label="Related policies" id="ar-ref-related">
    <h2 class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">17.</span> Related policies</h2>
    <ul class="ar-pol__related-list" role="list">
      <li><a href="{{ ar_shipping_url }}">Shipping Policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ ar_privacy_url }}">Privacy Policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ ar_terms_url }}">Terms of Service</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ ar_contact_url }}">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</div>
